  "id": "clinical-judgment",
  "term": "clinical judgment",
  "definition": "Clinical judgment is the professional decision-making used by clinicians to assess a patient and choose appropriate actions in context. In this source, it is described as an essential part of multidisciplinary evaluation that cannot be replaced by a structured assessment framework alone.",
